    "# Colab A100 High-N Sweep Runner ($n \\in [600, 1000]$)\n",
    "## Vectorized Batch Screening, Multi-Core Relaxation, Streaming & Verified Teardown\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook coordinates the high-n square packing search across $n \\in [600, 1000]$ on an NVIDIA A100 GPU instance:\n",
    "1. **GPU Batch Screening**: Parallel container extent evaluation and pairwise SAT separation check via PyTorch CUDA tensors.\n",
    "2. **Parallel Multi-Core Relaxation**: Concurrent 4-sign-piece epigraph LP polish running across all available CPU cores.\n",
    "3. **Hybrid Generation Strategy**: Combines Pell-17 corrugated core + L-border wrapping with band end vacancy deletion and defect propagation.\n",
    "4. **Append-Only Streaming**: Evaluated candidates and winning layouts stream immediately to disk (`outputs/high_n_stream.jsonl` and CSV) with explicit `fsync` flushing to survive runtime disconnects.\n",
    "5. **50-Digit Interval Certification**: Official metric verification with high-precision interval arithmetic.\n",
    "6. **Verified Teardown Guard**: Programmatic disconnect via `google.colab.runtime.unassign()` with safety guards to eliminate idle compute charges."
   ]
  },
